# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/
__pycache__/

# Examples directory (third-party reference projects)
examples/*
!examples/README.md

# Local demo runtime artifacts
.demo/
*.db
*.log
sites.db

# Build products of the JavaScript projects in this tree.
# crates/deis-control/web/dist is one of these: the control-plane binary embeds
# it (build.rs writes an include_bytes! table), so `npm run build` in crates/deis-control/web has to run
# before the crate is built for release. Its build.rs creates the directory when
# it is missing, so the crate still compiles - the binary then serves the whole
# API and answers 404 for the dashboard pages, and says so with a build warning.
node_modules/
dist/
